<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike, Reebok,Fila.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike, Reebok,Fila.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Nike Inc as a strong buy, Fila Holdings SpA as a hold, and Reebok International Ltd as a buy.  </p>
<p>-- Nike class B shares rose 1/2 to 56-3/8, Reebok added 1-1/4 to 40-5/8, and Fila was off 2-3/4 to 68 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
